proton-autogen (2.5.3) noble; urgency=medium

  * New utilities:
    - proton-autogen --help-env (new in v2.5.3) for PRO users (EN/FR)

  * Patch:
    - proton_autogen --json-profile: export all profile environment variables in JSON format
    - proton_autogen --profile dx11: apply the selected profile type

  * User profile system (Pro mode):
    - JSON profiles stored in ~/.config/proton-autogen/profiles/
    - Allows per-game environment customization

  * --profile <name> option:
    - Loads and applies a user-defined profile at runtime
    - Safely overrides environment variables

